---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const solutions=[['Factory automation','Control products, operator interfaces, drives and networking for production environments.','For manufacturers and machine builders'],['Process and instrumentation','Measurement, analytics and control requirements for process-oriented operations.','For process plants and utilities'],['Project supply','BOM review, product coordination and documentation routing for project teams.','For integrators, OEMs and contractors'],['Panel and system support','A structured conversation from specification through installation and commissioning planning.','For engineering teams']];
---
<BaseLayout title="Solutions | Nubelon Technology" description="Industrial automation solutions connecting product supply, control requirements and project support.">
<header class="nav"><div class="wrap nav-inner"><a class="logo" href="/">NUBE<span>LON</span></a><nav class="nav-links"><a href="/products/">Products</a><a href="/services/">Services</a><a href="/brands/">Brands</a><a href="/industries/">Industries</a><a href="/solutions/">Solutions</a><a href="/resources/">Resources</a><a class="btn" href="/contact/">Request a Quote</a></nav></div></header>
<main><section class="hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Project solutions</div><h1>Connect the product<br/>to the project.</h1><p>Shape a practical path from control requirements and instrumentation needs to a coordinated project scope.</p><a class="btn" href="/contact/">Discuss a project ↗</a></div><img class="page-visual" src="/images/generated/nubelon-engineering-commissioning.webp" alt="AI concept image of engineers reviewing an electrical control cabinet" fetchpriority="high"/></section><section><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Solution pathways</div><h2>Start with the<br/>work to be done.</h2></div><p>Use these pathways to frame a technical conversation. Exact scope, brands and delivery terms are confirmed case by case.</p></div><div class="cards">{solutions.map(([title,desc,audience],i)=><article class="card"><span class="num">0{i+1}</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{desc}</p><small>{audience}</small></article>)}</div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap split"><div><div class="eyebrow">A clear next step</div><h2>Bring a brief,<br/>BOM or part number.</h2></div><p>Tell us the country, application, control platform, preferred brands and timeline. We will organize the requirement before discussing the next action.</p></div></section></main><footer><div class="wrap footer-row"><span>Nubelon Technology (Xiamen) Co., Ltd.</span><span>Project solutions · draft scope</span><span>sales@nubeloncontrols.com</span></div></footer></BaseLayout>
<style>.nav-inner{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;width:100%}.card small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:24px}.split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:70px;align-items:center}.split h2{font:600 clamp(32px,4vw,52px)/1 'Space Grotesk';letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:16px 0}.split p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7}.hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden}.page-visual{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;opacity:.42;mix-blend-mode:normal;z-index:0}.hero:before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(11,17,23,.96),rgba(11,17,23,.7) 48%,rgba(11,17,23,.3));z-index:1}.hero .wrap{position:relative;z-index:2}@media(max-width:760px){.split{display:block}.split p{margin-top:28px}.page-visual{opacity:.28}}</style>
